{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_001", "offset": 98, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 1, "text": "子長 漢代의 李尋을 가리키는 듯. 李尋의 字는 子長이며, 平陵人이다. 陰陽術에 뛰어났다. 『漢書』 권75 眭兩夏侯京翼李傳 참조.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_002", "offset": 110, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 2, "text": "叔度 後漢代의 黃憲을 가르키는 듯. 黃憲의 字는 叔度이며, 汝南 愼陽人이다. 『後漢書』 권53 黃憲傳 참조.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_003", "offset": 169, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 3, "text": "四像 四象. 日月星辰을 말함.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_004", "offset": 175, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 4, "text": "三才 天地人 또는 天地間의 만물.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_005", "offset": 324, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 5, "text": "二儀 天地 또는 陰陽.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_006", "offset": 326, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 6, "text": "丕緖 큰 공적.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_007", "offset": 367, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 7, "text": "介祉 큰 복.", "type": "각주"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": null, "offset": 369, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 8, "text": "其一", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": null, "offset": 418, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 9, "text": "其二", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": null, "offset": 468, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 10, "text": "其三", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": null, "offset": 516, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 11, "text": "其四", "type": "소자쌍행"}
{"chunkId": "chunk_geumseok-gskh_009_0080_0020_gskh_009_0080_0020_0020", "id": "gs_kr_004_0010_0030_0020_008", "offset": 571, "parentSeq": null, "seq": 12, "text": "班 위 王禎 墓誌銘에는 ‘禮班’으로 되어 있다.", "type": "각주"}
